  "scope": "B3-P1-X1 S2 Save Bisect diagnostic: instrument GameState.do_save_game() substeps with disk-level markers under user://s2_markers/ (m01_enter, m02_timestamp, m03_checksum, m04_stamp, m05_serialize, m06_dataprep, m07_pre_open, m08_open_done, m09_store, m10_close, m11_onsave_done). Each marker is a unique empty-content file whose presence/absence in the user data dir bisects the B2-I1 debounce-save freeze into a specific substep. Pure observational CODE_PATCH: no gameplay behavior changes, no new res:// paths, marker writer is a standalone helper injected immediately before func do_save_game(). Anchors verified unique against pristine 04_recovered content (whole-file preimage 0976e0f4...). Applies on top of the full B2-I1 aggregate chain (14 mods) per task spec.",
